<!-- 编辑收货地址（v5「字重」稿 A7）：凹槽输入框 + 地区选择 + 默认开关（键帽滑块+紫灯）；底部 删除（按住）/保存。
     所在地区＝微信内置 <picker mode="region"> 省市区级联（全国数据运行时自带·region 空格拼接为真相源）。
     maxlength ≤ 云端 createOrder 地址快照截断：表单比云端宽，多打的字会在下单时被悄悄截掉（手机号按拍板 6 限 11 位）。
     有改动时 <leave-sheet> 拦返回/侧滑；拦截武装会冻结页面级滚动，故表单套 scroll-view 自己滚、底部键不随滚。 -->
<view class="ae-page">
  <v5-nav title="{{title}}" guard="{{true}}" bind:back="onBack" />
  <scroll-view class="ae-scroll" scroll-y="{{true}}" enhanced="{{true}}" show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <view class="ae">
      <view class="ae-field">
        <text class="t-sys ae-label t-cap">收货人</text>
        <input class="well ae-input {{focus === 'name' ? 'well-focus' : ''}}" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bind:input="onInput" cursor-spacing="24" confirm-type="next" bind:confirm="onNameNext"
          bind:focus="onFocus" bind:blur="onBlur" maxlength="40" placeholder="姓名" placeholder-class="ae-ph" />
      </view>
      <view class="ae-field">
        <text class="t-sys ae-label t-cap">手机号</text>
        <input class="well ae-input ae-mono {{focus === 'phone' ? 'well-focus' : ''}} {{phoneLack ? 'ae-warn' : ''}}" value="{{phone}}" data-field="phone" bind:input="onInput" cursor-spacing="24" focus="{{focusNext === 'phone'}}"
          bind:focus="onFocus" bind:blur="onBlur" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="11 位手机号" placeholder-class="ae-ph" />
        <view wx:if="{{phoneLack}}" class="t-sys ae-err">
          <px-anim name="alert" size="2" hold="400" />
          <text>手机号少了 {{phoneLack}} 位</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="ae-field">
        <text class="t-sys ae-label t-cap">所在地区</text>
        <picker mode="region" value="{{regionArr}}" bind:change="onRegionChange">
          <view class="well ae-region" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" data-k="flat" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">
            <text class="ae-region-t {{region ? '' : 'ae-ph'}}">{{region || '选择省市区'}}</text>
            <text class="t-sys ae-pick t-cap">选择</text>
            <px-i name="arrow" tone="var(--v5-ink-2)" />
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="ae-field">
        <text class="t-sys ae-label t-cap">详细地址</text>
        <textarea class="well ae-area {{focus === 'detail' ? 'well-focus' : ''}}" value="{{detail}}" data-field="detail" bind:input="onInput" cursor-spacing="24"
          bind:focus="onFocus" bind:blur="onBlur" maxlength="120" auto-height="{{true}}" disable-default-padding="{{true}}"
          placeholder="街道、门牌号" placeholder-class="ae-ph" />
      </view>
      <!-- 从结算页来新增（pick）：选址＝设默认，开关不露（存时自动设默认） -->
      <view wx:if="{{!pick}}" class="ae-def hit44" bind:tap="onToggleDefault">
        <text class="ae-def-t">设为默认地址</text>
        <view class="well ae-switch">
          <view class="k k-sm k-light ae-knob {{isDefault ? 'on' : ''}}">
            <px-i wx:if="{{isDefault}}" name="led" tone="var(--v5-violet)" />
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="ae-dock">
    <view wx:if="{{id}}" class="k k-light k-48 k-sq ae-del {{deleting ? 'ae-del-on' : ''}}" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-light-down" hover-stay-time="100"
      catch:touchstart="onDelHoldStart" bind:touchmove="onDelHoldMove" catch:touchend="onDelHoldEnd" catch:touchcancel="onDelHoldCancel">
      <view class="ae-del-fill"></view>
      <px-i class="ae-del-t" name="trash" />
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{valid}}" class="k k-ink k-48 ae-save" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-ink-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onSave" data-k="ink" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp"><px-i name="check" /></view>
    <view wx:else class="k k-flat k-off k-48 ae-save" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onSave" data-k="flat" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp"><px-i name="check" /></view>
  </view>
</view>

<leave-sheet id="leave" dirty="{{dirty}}" title="放弃修改地址？" sub="刚填的内容不会保存。" />
<px-fx id="fx" />
